## 8. Communication Protocol Design

### 8.1 Device Discovery (UDP)
- App broadcasts `FIND_ATTENDANCE_DEVICE` on UDP port 8888
- ESP32 replies with IP address and device identifier
- Enables zero-configuration networking

### 8.2 Data Exchange (HTTP + AES)
- `GET /poll` — Returns latest attendance event (AES encrypted)
- `POST /enroll?id=<N>` — Initiates fingerprint enrollment
- Payload: JSON → AES-128 Encrypt → Base64 Encode → HTTP Body

